{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horse Plinko, the most unhinged way to win big with horses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine classic Plinko, but instead of plastic discs, you're dropping full-on horses. It\u2019s chaotic, it\u2019s hilarious, and somehow... it works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Horse Plinko is a ridiculous physics-based game where strategy meets slapstick. Score points, unlock upgrades, and discover just how far one horse can fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In Horse Plinko you will:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop Horses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make Money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy Upgrades in the Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prestige at the Shrine (Work in Progress)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750360?t=1748278227","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750360?t=1748278227","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750360/3252ec06154884fc99545d45a89f71d90c911c4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748278227","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750360/3252ec06154884fc99545d45a89f71d90c911c4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748278227","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horse Plinko, the most unhinged way to win big with horses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine classic Plinko, but instead of plastic discs, you're dropping full-on horses. It\u2019s chaotic, it\u2019s hilarious, and somehow... it works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Horse Plinko is a ridicu